        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanover%2C_New_Mexico",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town boasted the Emerald Zinc Mine, built during World War I, and also mined copper.",
