      ],
      "source": "https://www.newmexico.org/places-to-visit/ghost-towns/hanover-fierro/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A post office opened in Hanover in 1892, marking its official establishment.",
